# Harness Evolution

When an agent makes a repeatable mistake:

1. Record in [HARNESS_CHANGELOG.md](../../HARNESS_CHANGELOG.md)
2. Prefer **sensor** (deterministic) over **guide** (prose)
3. Follow [docs/workflows/harness-evolution.md](../../docs/workflows/harness-evolution.md)

Upgrade path for rules:
```
prose rule → lint rule → CI gate → hook
```

Never add a rule without a plan to verify it works.
